# 🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒
# Milli Tax Vault — Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit the real .env file.
# 🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒

# Backend
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://milli:milli_dev_2026@localhost:5432/milli_tax
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-random-string

# Flask server
FLASK_ENV=development
FLASK_PORT=5000
SECRET_KEY=change-me-to-a-random-string

# Plaid integration
PLAID_CLIENT_ID=your-plaid-client-id
PLAID_SECRET=your-plaid-secret
PLAID_ENV=sandbox
# Webhook URL for real-time transaction notifications
# Register this in Plaid dashboard: https://your-domain.com/api/plaid/webhook
PLAID_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-domain.com/api/plaid/webhook

# Apple Push Notifications
APNS_TEAM_ID=your-apple-team-id
APNS_KEY_ID=your-apns-key-id
APNS_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=path/to/AuthKey.p8
APNS_BUNDLE_ID=app.milli.tax

# TaxBandits
TAXBANDITS_CLIENT_ID=your-taxbandits-client-id
TAXBANDITS_SECRET=your-taxbandits-secret

# Frontend API URL (for Capacitor)
REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Optional: Sentry / observability
SENTRY_DSN=

# Stripe (for subscription billing AND card issuing)
# Same key handles both subscription payments and physical card production
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxx
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxx

# Alpaca (for brokerage integration)
ALPACA_API_KEY=xxx
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=xxx

# Google Cloud Vision (for receipt OCR)
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./service-account.json

# Persona (for KYC verification)
PERSONA_API_KEY=xxx
PERSONA_TEMPLATE_ID=xxx

# Apple Sign In
APPLE_CLIENT_ID=xxx
APPLE_TEAM_ID=xxx
APPLE_KEY_ID=xxx
APPLE_PRIVATE_KEY=xxx

# Google Sign In
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxx
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=xxx